 to November came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same pair ran 52% of normal, and September to October ran 45%. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 21% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 13994 had its driest year in 1954 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
